<title>INDIA: India 96/97 aluminium output 523,849 tonnes.</title>
<headline>India 96/97 aluminium output 523,849 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>India produced 523,849 tonnes of aluminium in 1996/97 (April-March), up slightly from 521,031 tonnes in the previous fiscal year, the Mines Ministry said on Monday.</p>
<p>The country produced 48,118 tonnes of aluminium in March against a target of 48,703 tonnes, the statement said.</p>
<p>It said state-run National Aluminium Company Ltd exported 45,107 tonnes of alumina and 9,058 tonnes of aluminium in March.  </p>
