<p> BALCO    100,000	  8,069	    91,539	92,645</p>
<p> INDAL    117,000	  3,456	    39,839	58,694</p>
<p> HINDALCO 210,000	 16,042	   165,319     177,404</p>
<p> NALCO    218,000	 18,568	   203,824     192,288</p>
<p> MALCO     25,000	  1,983	    23,328	   nil</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Total    670,000	 48,118	   523,849     521,031</p>
